---
description: Repo hygiene to keep diffs focused and avoid committing build artifacts
alwaysApply: true
---

# Avoid committing generated junk

- Never add/commit `.aws-sam/` build output or SAM artifacts.
- Never add/commit `.DS_Store`.
- Never add/commit `__pycache__/` or `*.pyc` (keep `__pycache__/` out via `.gitignore`).

# Testing / validation after substantive edits

- For Python logic changes: run `python3 -m unittest -q tests/test_sentiment_analyzer.py tests/test_trade_executor.py tests/test_strategy_promotion.py tests/test_strategy_promotion_runner.py tests/test_exit_manager.py` (install `pydantic` and `pandas` for the full set).
- For `template.yaml` / IaC changes: run `sam validate --lint`.

